OL,3,GNEWSAFirst phase of bus lane work set
OL,4,Ato last for weeks
OL,5,
OL,6,FWork is starting on a new bus lane
OL,7,Faimed at making journeys on public
OL,8,Ftransport quicker.
OL,10,FThe lane on Reading's London Road,
OL,11,Fbetween Sidmouth Street and London
OL,12,FStreet, is part of a wider package of
OL,13,Fmeasures across the town.
OL,15,FA temporary lane closure between
OL,16,FSidmouth Street and Kendrick Road is
OL,17,Fexpected to last until the middle of
OL,18,Fthis month. The main part of the bus
OL,19,Flane work is expected to resume in the
OL,20,FNew Year.
OL,23,APub: 02-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
